m. Hcemorrhoids, fissures, ulceration of anus\nand perineum, purple, covered ivith crusts. Atrocious\npains with and after each stool. Sudden, pasty diar-\nrhoea, with faintness in abdomen."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"chest","label":"Chest","startLine":25902,"endLine":25904,"text":"Sticking pain in left chest. Heat in chest.\nDull shooting from front to back through heart."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"extremities","label":"Extremities","startLine":25905,"endLine":25907,"text":"Pain in wrist and fingers; knees\nand toes. Weakness of legs, inhibiting walking."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"sleep","label":"Sleep","startLine":25908,"endLine":25909,"text":"Terrifying dreams, nighmare."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"skin","label":"Skin","startLine":25910,"endLine":25919,"text":"Sensitive, painful. Ulcers below coccyx,\n\n568\n\nPw^iONIA — PALLADIUM\n\naround sacrum ; varicose veins. Ulcers in general,\nfrom pressure, bed-sores, etc. Itching, burning, as\nfrom nettles."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":25920,"endLine":25925,"text":"Compare: Human.; SiL; Aesc.;\nRatanh. (great constriction of anus; stools forced with\ngreat effort).\n\nAntidotes: Ratanh.; Aloe."}],"corpusPassages":[]}